<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT-Morgan raises National Steel.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Morgan raises National Steel.</headline>
<dateline>PITTSBURGH 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.P. Morgan steel analyst Mike Gambardella said he raised his second-quarter estimate for National Steel Corp to $1.00 per share from $0.86 per share.</p>
<p>-- Gambardella said he also raised his full-year '97 estimate on National Steel to $2.90 per share from $2.45 per share.</p>
<p>-- He cited the company's continued strong operating performance and significant deleveraging that asset sales have produced.</p>
</text>
